    "updated_at": "2015-08-30T22:44:07Z",
    "body": "Ok, so Hixie's comment in that bug says that `<button>`s should be non-replaced.\n\nRunning [bz's testcase](https://bug1060131.bmoattachments.org/attachment.cgi?id=8481618) in various browsers confirms that Firefox currently stands alone in treating `<button>`s as replaced. Chrome, Safari, Edge, IE11, and Opera 12 all render it the same as each other; Firefox doesn't.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
